id: team-reliance
name: Team Reliance
order: 4
category: mind
importance: secondary
description: >
  Unable to fend for themselves reliably without superior technology, Tuffles rely on their comrades to survive.
text: >
  Team Reliance (Mind): Unable to fend for themselves reliably without superior technology, Tuffles rely on their comrades to survive.
  (1)-[Passive]: All of your Allies on an adjacent Square to you have their Combat Rolls increased by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Insight, Personality, or Scholarship Modifier (whichever is highest). This effect does not stack; if multiple Characters are applying this effect, only gain the highest bonus from among them.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an adjacent Ally uses an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the United Attack Maneuver without spending an Action through its effects.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an adjacent Ally is hit by an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, increase the Wound Roll by x(T) and you must target the Character that hit your Ally with one of their Attacking Maneuvers.
---

[passive]
# (1) Read by each adjacent Ally - the highest of those giving it (actor-character.mjs allyRolls).
allow teamReliance.aura;
# (2) Joining an adjacent Ally's attack: a "No Action" box in the United Attack's window, once a Round (united-attack.mjs).
allow teamReliance.freeUnited;
# (3) An adjacent Ally hit: the Basic Attack out of sequence at whoever hit them, offered on the attack's card once a Round - x(T),
# Need for Revenge's Spite, on its Wound Roll (chat.mjs offerTeamReliance).
allow teamReliance.strike;
